---

# Explainability

Example

Current training emphasizes maximal strength because this adaptation provides the foundation for the subsequent power-focused mesocycle.

The athlete should always understand the purpose of the current phase.

---

# Limitations

Periodization provides structure.

It does not eliminate uncertainty.

Unexpected events may require adaptation.

Effective planning remains flexible.

