Hybrid Periodization Models

---

# Success Criteria

The model succeeds when:

Training remains coherent.

Adaptation progresses predictably.

Fatigue remains manageable.

Competition readiness improves.

Long-term performance continues to increase.

---

# Final Principle

Periodization is not about organizing workouts.

It is about organizing adaptation.

Every session should make sense today,

because it also prepares tomorrow.